ild artifact out the other end now 2026 08 12 09 06 bob doe it actual run or just build 2026 08 12 09 24 evan run instal it on a window box and it s pass the same saniti check we run on linux 2026 08 12 09 26 diana doe this mean window compat is done 2026 08 12 09 36 evan the engin work for the window build is complet packag work the binari is sound code sign is a separ item we haven t even start on yet so i wouldn t call the whole thing close 2026 08 12 09 45 alic understood we ll track sign on it own good progress on the build itself\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e8e7f9688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-12-windows-build-artifact.md\", \"id\": \"61bccaf0a0dfface\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3398020285997659, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.13555466942823702, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8163792, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-12-windows-build-artifact.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e8e7f9688a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-12-windows-build-artifact.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-12-windows-build-artifact.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 859, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:04:30\", \"token_count\": 268, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-39\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-39\\n\\n**Title**: Fix Windows builds and clear Defender/SmartScreen signing\\n\\n**Status**: Active\\n\\n**Assignee**: Evan\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\