 a untrust by default 2026 09 02 10 13 alic is the miss code sign certif the actual blocker here 2026 09 02 10 14 evan yes we still don t have one until we do everi pilot instal is go to trip a warn at best get block outright at worst 2026 09 02 10 16 diana releas blocker 2026 09 02 10 17 bob copi 2026 09 02 1018 evan it stay open a far a i m concern this isn t someth we can work around on the engin side we need the certif 2026 09 02 10 59 alic let s keep it open on the releas gate rather than push it off the board i ll chase the certif process\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e911fa1a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"id\": \"4223f88ffbddf892\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.31314119808051094, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.12209489725787283, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7589159, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e911fa1a8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-09-02-windows-signing-gap.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 927, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:53\", \"token_count\": 288, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-10\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Pre-Release Audit\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-15\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nPre-release gate review: Docker slim/CVE, Windows sig